<title>SPAIN: Retevision - Endesa group bid exceeds BCH grp bid.</title>
<headline>Retevision - Endesa group bid exceeds BCH grp bid.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The offer for Retevision from the consortium headed by Spain's Endesa exceeded by more than 32 billion pesetas the offer presented by the BCH consortium, secretary general of Retevision Jose Manuel Garcia-Mon said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Retevision is to become Spain's second basic telephone operator.</p>
</text>
